{"ts": 1792755099.1971464, "iso": "2026-10-23T11:31:39", "event": "witness_note", "payload": {"note": "Poll run 2026-10-23T11:31Z. NO canon change; canon hash b20375d389cb505d / 71 papers, identical to the 2026-10-22T20:04Z baseline. Confirmed twice by independent paths: the watcher's own poll_canon() and a separate curl probe of live-canon.superinstance.dev/api/canon (HTTP 200, 13720 bytes) whose sha256(json, sort_keys)[:16] recomputed to the same b20375d389cb505d; the response body carries the count under 'count' (71), not 'paper_count', so the 10-22 fix is load-bearing and still correct. Accordingly NO canon-change witness note is written and no gamma/eta delta is claimed \u2014 a hash match is not a transition. state.json is byte-unchanged and bookkeeper.wal still does not exist, which is the correct no-op outcome: bookkeeper_tick() is only reached from the first_poll and canon_changed branches, so 14.5h of stable canon produces zero ticks. Two environment notes. (1) The requested path /workspace/repos/ai-writings/... did not exist and /workspace was an empty NAS mount (600G/600G, 100%, 0 bytes avail) \u2014 the ai-writings clone was absent again, the 7th consecutive wipe with the named path gone. Recovery was a sparse clone of SuperInstance/AI-Writings into /tmp (git sparse-checkout set bots/wesley-mechanic + bots/substrate-bus), needed because the script hardcodes /tmp/wm-run/bots/... for witness.log, state.json and bookkeeper.wal AND sys.path.insert('/tmp/wm-run/bots/substrate-bus') \u2014 so substrate_bus must be staged alongside it or the import dies. Staged script md5 206682962c06f9814a5db65c2fbc7267, byte-identical to upstream; no code changes were needed this run. (2) Carried forward, unresolved: bookkeeper budget=1000.0 against gamma+eta=70.0 makes 'last_conserved' a constant false by construction \u2014 the predicate cannot ever be satisfied by the delta path, so that field still carries no signal.", "canon_poll": "OK 200 \u2014 no change vs 2026-10-22T20:04Z baseline", "baseline_hash": "b20375d389cb505d", "canon_count": 71, "canon_changed": false, "verified_by": "watcher poll_canon() + independent curl probe (13720 bytes, sha256[:16] match)", "script_md5": "206682962c06f9814a5db65c2fbc7267", "workspace_status": "NAS mount 100% full, 0 bytes avail; /workspace/repos absent; recovered via sparse clone to /tmp", "open_defect": "bookkeeper budget=1000.0 vs gamma+eta=70.0 makes last_conserved a constant false"}, "hash": "88839488ea23e66c"}
