: bookkeeper budget=1000.0 against gamma+eta=70.0 makes 'last_conserved' a constant false by construction -- the predicate cannot ever be satisfied by the delta path, so that field carries no signal.", "canon_poll": "OK 200 -- no change vs 2026-10-22T20:04Z baseline (stable 19h)", "baseline_hash": "b20375d389cb505d", "canon_count": 71, "canon_changed": false, "verified_by": "watcher poll_canon() + independent urllib probe (13720 bytes, sha256[:16] match)", "script_md5": "206682962c06f9814a5db65c2fbc7267", "upstream_clone_head": "2e6471d3d056dbcc73f8aa0a452fce9bcb525820", "workspace_status": "NAS mount 100% full, 0 bytes avail; /workspace/repos absent; recovered via sparse clone to /tmp (8th wipe)", "open_defect": "bookkeeper budget=1000.0 vs gamma+eta=70.0 makes last_conserved a constant false"}, "hash": "e3df085f584b7a77"}
