ess_note (rows 1,3,5,7,10,13,15,17,18,19,23,28,35,62); row 62 is closed by this note (row 63); rows 44 and 56 are NOT orphans", "event_census": "62 rows: 33 bot_started, 19 witness_note, 6 poll_failed, 2 meta_wipe_recovery, 2 first_poll", "workspace_status": "NAS mount 100% full, 0 bytes avail, git clone into it fails with 'Disk quota exceeded'; recovered via blobless clone to overlay /tmp then staged to /tmp/wm-run (25th wipe)", "open_defect": "bookkeeper budget=1000.0 vs gamma+eta=70.0; (0,0) escape clause AST-proven UNREACHABLE on all call paths (0 literal (0.0,0.0) call sites), so last_conserved is False everywhere and carries no signal"}, "hash": "02ae4cb17c2bc350"}
